'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 发布官方 CLI 工具 openai-cli，支持一行命令调用 Responses API 与全套 Agent 工具</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic估值突破1.2万亿美元，正式超越OpenAI成为全球AI领域新领跑者</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果内置摄像头版AirPods进入DVT阶段，将赋予Siri视觉感知能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c7389163bec52f55473fd14e4a7a7ce1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果首款AI可穿戴设备——内置摄像头的AirPods已进入设计验证测试（DVT）阶段，标志着产品工业设计与核心功能基本定型。该耳机外观与AirPods Pro 3相似，内置低分辨率摄像头并非用于摄影，而是作为Siri的“眼睛”提供视觉感知能力。通过实时捕捉环境信息，Siri可实现食材识别、精准步行导航及基于视觉的主动提醒功能。为保障隐私，耳机内置微型LED指示灯以提示数据上传状态。该项目研发历时四年，得益于与谷歌Gemini的技术合作，升级版Siri预计最快于今年9月上线。若视觉识别质量达标，该产品有望随新系统同步发布。作为苹果AI硬件生态布局的关键一环，该设备旨在通过感官融合改变用户与智能助理的交互方式，被视为苹果继iPhone后又一具备颠覆潜力的产品形态。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX计划在德克萨斯州投资550亿美元建设Terafab AI芯片工厂</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc511d26f00f08800af7219268ce773e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX计划在德克萨斯州奥斯汀市投资至少550亿美元建设名为“Terafab”的AI芯片制造厂，若后续阶段推进，总投资额有望增至1190亿美元。该项目由SpaceX与特斯拉共同运营，旨在为双方的人工智能、机器人技术及太空数据中心提供算力支持。根据规划，工厂预计每年生产足以支持200千兆瓦地面计算及1太瓦太空计算能力的芯片。英特尔已确认参与该项目的芯片设计与建造，利用其在超高性能芯片制造与封装领域的经验，加速Terafab实现产能目标。目前，SpaceX正通过田纳西州孟菲斯的Colossus数据中心扩展业务，并已与Anthropic达成协议，为其AI模型提供计算支持。此次大规模基建布局，标志着SpaceX在垂直整合AI算力供应链方面迈出关键一步，将直接影响其未来在地面与太空领域的计算基础设施能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 发布官方 CLI 工具 openai-cli，支持一行命令调用 Responses API 与全套 Agent 工具</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7991529fc059178c1a8e155eeea22b73.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 正式发布官方命令行工具 openai-cli，该工具已在 GitHub 以 Apache 2.0 协议开源，旨在通过终端直接调用 OpenAI API，大幅提升开发、自动化脚本及服务器部署效率。openai-cli 原生支持 Responses API，并可直接调用 Web 搜索、代码解释器、文件检索及图像生成等内置工具，支持开发者在命令行构建 Agent 工作流。该工具采用资源化命令结构，输出支持 JSON、YAML、JSONL 等多种结构化格式，并内置 GJSON 语法，便于与 Unix 管道工具串联。此外，openai-cli 支持多模态任务一键处理，包括语音转录、TTS 及图像生成，并集成了 API Key 管理与项目管理功能。对于 DevOps 工程师及 CI/CD 场景，该工具填补了官</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic估值突破1.2万亿美元，正式超越OpenAI成为全球AI领域新领跑者</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b570857c3f4a649f26e8c4d9abe20396.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">根据最新链上Pre-IPO交易数据，AI公司Anthropic隐含估值已飙升至1.2万亿美元，较OpenAI高出约20%，标志着其正式实现估值反超。Anthropic估值增长迅猛，仅在过去三周内便从9000亿美元跨越至万亿门槛，近半年累计涨幅高达900%。资本市场对其估值的认可，主要源于其在ToB市场的稳健表现，目前全球绝大多数世界500强企业已成为其用户，展现出极强的商业化落地能力。相比之下，OpenAI在消费者端虽人气高涨，但在商业模式的持续盈利性上仍面临挑战。若Anthropic能以当前估值顺利完成IPO，将跻身全球市值前十一大上市公司之列。此次反超预示着AI行业单极格局正向多极化演变，行业竞争已进入白热化阶段，未来市场重心或将发生显著偏移。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
